      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
          "name": "MD inbound webhook token"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Posted by the Go job step clip.open_review (called by the Render Workflows task clip_ingest after transcode → blur → flash_check → propose_windows). Signed envelope (no raw-body handling needed in n8n): body = { ts, payload: '<JSON string>', sig: 'sha256=<hex HMAC of ts.payload>' }. payload = { clip_id, version, proposed_windows_count, blur_audit_url }."
